---
import data from '../data/gundem.json';
import {gun} from '../lib/bicim';
const d=data.doviz;
---
<section class="panel gundem" aria-label="Döviz, hava durumu ve akaryakıt">
 <div class="gundem__kur"><h2>Dolar / TL</h2><p>Alış <strong>{d.alis.toLocaleString('tr-TR',{minimumFractionDigits:4})}</strong> · Satış <strong>{d.satis.toLocaleString('tr-TR',{minimumFractionDigits:4})}</strong></p><small><a href={d.kaynak}>TCMB gösterge kuru</a> · {gun(d.tarih)}</small></div>
 <div><h2>Hava durumu</h2><div class="maas-alan"><label for="hava-il">Şehir</label><select id="hava-il">{data.hava.iller.map((c,i)=><option value={i}>{c.ad}</option>)}</select></div><p data-hava-sonuc></p><small><a href={data.hava.kaynak}>Open-Meteo model verisi</a></small></div>
 <div><h2>Akaryakıt · Shell</h2><div class="gundem__secim"><div class="maas-alan"><label for="yakit-il">İl</label><select id="yakit-il">{data.yakit.iller.map(c=><option value={c.kod} selected={c.kod==='054'}>{c.ad}</option>)}</select></div><div class="maas-alan"><label for="yakit-ilce">İlçe</label><select id="yakit-ilce"/></div></div><dl data-yakit-sonuc></dl><small>KDV dahil · Birimler ürün adlarında belirtilmiştir · {gun(data.yakit.gecerliTarih)} · <a href={data.yakit.kaynak}>Shell il tavan tavsiye / otogaz tavan fiyatları</a>. İstasyon fiyatı farklı olabilir.</small></div>
 <p class="gundem__durum" data-gundem-tarih></p>
 <script type="application/json" id="gundem-veri" set:html={JSON.stringify(data).replace(/</g,'\\u003c')}/>
</section>
<script>import '../scripts/gundem';</script>
<style>
.gundem{padding:var(--space-lg);display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,2fr);gap:var(--space-lg);}.gundem>div{display:grid;align-content:start;gap:var(--space-xs);min-width:0;}.gundem h2{font-size:var(--text-lg);}.gundem small{color:var(--color-muted);font-size:var(--text-xs);}.gundem__secim{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:var(--space-sm);}.gundem dl{margin:0;display:grid;gap:var(--space-2xs);font-size:var(--text-sm);}.gundem :global(dl>div){display:flex;gap:var(--space-xs);justify-content:space-between;}.gundem :global(dd){margin:0;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}.gundem__durum{grid-column:1/-1;font-size:var(--text-xs);color:var(--color-muted);}@media(max-width:1050px){.gundem{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));}.gundem>div:last-of-type{grid-column:1/-1;}}@media(max-width:600px){.gundem{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);padding:var(--space-md);}}
</style>
